    "id": "prop:oracle-attainment-classification",
    "kind": "proposition",
    "statement": "Under \\(S<S_{\\star}\\), \\(\\eta<\\gamma/(2\\gamma+d)\\), and therefore \\(R_n/\\rho_n^{\\mathrm{or}}\\asymp n^{\\gamma/(2\\gamma+d)-\\eta}\\to\\infty\\). Hence no parameter tuple in the stated strict below-elbow regime attains the same-class supplied-propensity benchmark. At the sanity-check boundary \\(S=S_{\\star}\\), the two exponents coincide and reduce to \\(n^{-\\gamma/(2\\gamma+d)}\\) without a logarithmic multiplier.",
    "free_symbols": [
      "S",
